    "details": "<p><strong>Event Details</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li><strong>Date:</strong> 22 October 2026</li>\n<li><strong>Time:</strong> 11:00 AM &ndash; 1:30 PM</li>\n<li><strong>Venue:</strong> Naidu Hall, I.T.S Engineering College, Greater Noida</li>\n<li><strong>Registration Fee:</strong> ₹300 per team</li>\n<li><strong>Prize Pool:</strong> ₹15,000 (₹7,000 / ₹5,000 / ₹3,000) + Free Incubation</li>\n<li><strong>Team Size:</strong> 2 participants per team</li>\n<li><strong>Coordinator:</strong> Miss. Anushka Tyagi</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Event Description</strong></p>\n<p>Junior Ideathon is an opportunity for school students to identify pressing problems around them and develop innovative solutions with clear implementation planning. Participants present their ideas using a PPT/PDF pitch deck and explain the problem, proposed solution, feasibility, impact, and scalability before the jury.</p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines</strong></p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Participants must report to the venue on time</li>\n<li>Carry a valid School ID Card for verification</li>\n<li>The presentation must be submitted in PPT/PDF format 10&ndash;15 minutes before the event begins</li>\n<li>Each team gets 5 minutes for the presentation, followed by 2 minutes of Q&amp;A</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Judging Criteria</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">Criteria</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">Weightage</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Problem Identification</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Innovation</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Feasibility</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Impact</td>\n<td>20%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Presentation</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Scalability</td>\n<td>10%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Disqualification</strong></p>\n<p>The following will result in disqualification:</p>\n<ul dir=\"ltr\">\n<li>Misconduct</li>\n<li>Cheating or plagiarism</li>\n<li>External assistance</li>\n<li>Misrepresentation of participant identity</li>\n<li>Any violation of the general event rules</li>\n</ul>\n<p>The final decision rests with the jury and organizing committee.</p>\n<p><strong>Opportunities for Winners:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Incubation Support</strong> &mdash; Up to <strong>₹90,000</strong><br />Get incubation support worth up to<strong> ₹90,000</strong> for <strong>18 months</strong> to develop and scale your innovative idea.</p>\n<p>Get <strong>Truscholar credits</strong> -- Up to <strong>₹14.2+ Lakhs</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Expert Mentorship</strong><br />Receive guidance from industry experts and experienced mentors to refine your idea, strategy, and business model.</p>\n<p><strong>Product Development Support</strong><br />Get hands-on support to build, test, and refine your product and turn your idea into a market-ready solution.</p>",
    "end_date": "2026-10-19T00:00:00+05:30",
